Re: Amendments to Southwest Industrial Park Annexation(Agenda Item #13)
The following attachments were submitted due to a recent change in ownership of a parcel currently
being annexed into the City.The parcel is located adjacent to Southwest Drive, to the south of 5th Street.
The new ownerisC.H.Yarber Crane Services.The purpose of the ownership change is to allow C.H.
Yarbertobe the owner of record of all land within an expedited plat(which is being processed
concurrently).
Therevised ordinance indicates the change in ownership, andrevises the entitlement tomatchthe
attached map submitted to the Development Department.
The attached map has been submitted to the Development Office to resolve conditions recommended by
staff.The revised map fulfills all conditions and staff recommends this item be approved without
conditions.
